{"id":"prepositions-0068","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 68","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Plastic waste is a serious threat ___ marine life.","hint":"threat ___ sth/sb","explanation":"a threat TO somebody/something."},{"answer":"from","accept":["against"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Sunscreen protects the skin ___ UV rays.","hint":"protect ___ sth harmful","explanation":"protect somebody/something FROM (or AGAINST) harm."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"It never occurred ___ me to check the address.","hint":"occur ___ sb (come to mind)","explanation":"it occurred TO somebody = they thought of it."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Is there any excuse ___ being so rude?","hint":"excuse ___ sth","explanation":"an excuse FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"with","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They provided us ___ everything we needed.","hint":"provide sb ___ sth","explanation":"provide somebody WITH something, or provide something FOR somebody."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I much prefer coffee ___ tea.","hint":"prefer A ___ B","explanation":"prefer A TO B (never \u0027than\u0027)."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They\u0027ve invited us ___ their wedding in May.","hint":"invite sb ___ sth","explanation":"invite somebody TO an event."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Several parents objected ___ the new timetable.","hint":"object ___ sth","explanation":"object TO something."}]}